blic","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-09-17T21:17:11Z","label":{"name":"Core framework","color":"BFD4F2"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":19760026425,"node_id":"RTE_lADOAJbtsc7MHLnIzwAAAASZyhM5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/events/19760026425","actor":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-09-17T21:23:38Z","rename":{"from":"Backward compatibility issue with 3.0.0->3.0.1 upgrade","to":"Tuples with more than 8 values are not properly serialized"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":19761075147,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAJbtsc7MHLnIzwAAAASZ2hPL","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/events/19761075147","actor":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"84ea35c2d6d12118be48c9bbe1ec0eae03975782","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/commits/84ea35c2d6d12118be48c9bbe1ec0eae03975782","created_at":"2025-09-17T22:57:59Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/comments/3304797956","html_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit/issues/3401#issuecomment-3304797956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3401","id":3304797956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJbtsc7E-zcE","user":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T23:03:28Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T23:03:28Z","body":"For those who might be curious what's happening here, it turns out that `(int, int, int, int, int, int, int, int, int)` isn't `ValueTuple<int, int, int, int, int, int, int, int, int>` as you might expect. `ValueTuple` stops at 8 generic arguments. The compiler, therefore, is creating a tuple of type `ValueTuple<int, int, int, int, int, int, int, ValueTuple<int, int>>`, using the last generic type to continue on with additional tuples. This is how we ended up with \"parameter count mismatch\", since the type we were creating was `ValueTuple``8` but we had 9 ints as our argument list.\n\nStrictly speaking, a tuple with 17 items wasn't necessary to trigger this (9 was enough), though I did write tests for 3, 10, and 17, just to ensure that we continued to dive down all the way into the tuple depths, since a 17 member tuple is actually a tuple which contains 7 values + a tuple which contains 7 values + a tuple which contains 3 values. 😄 ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/comments/3304797956/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https